    <h2>How to Verify Before You Go</h2>
    <p>Operator details — hours, license type, menu, pricing — can change without notice. To avoid a wasted trip, verify directly before visiting:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cannabis Cured</strong> — (207) 682-0130</li>
      <li><strong>Above and Beyond Cannabis</strong> — (207) 563-6886</li>
      <li><strong>Greenport Cannabis</strong> — (207) 563-6928</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Adult-use customers: bring a valid government-issued photo ID showing you are 21 or older. Medical patients: bring your Maine MMMP card and a valid photo ID. Out-of-state medical patients from a reciprocity state should call ahead to confirm acceptance.</p>
  </section>

  

